fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsrc.html#gst_app_src_simple_callbacks_set_enough_data","fragment":"\n\tgst_app_src_simple_callbacks_set_enough_data\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSrcSimpleCallbacks.prototype.set_enough_data\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSrcSimpleCallbacks.set_enough_data\n\nSets the enough data callback on cb.\nOnce cb is set on an GstAppSrc it is not possible anymore to change any of\nthe callbacks inside it.\nParameters:\nthe callbacks\nEOS callback\nthe user data\nGDestroyNotify to free the user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nSets the enough data callback on cb.\nOnce cb is set on an GstApp.AppSrc it is not possible anymore to change any of\nthe callbacks inside it.\nParameters:\nthe callbacks\nEOS callback\nthe user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nSets the enough data callback on cb.\nOnce cb is set on an GstApp.AppSrc it is not possible anymore to change any of\nthe callbacks inside it.\nParameters:\nthe callbacks\nEOS callback\nthe user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});